ude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"bearhide-torso\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"titan\">Titan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"camel\">Camel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"weasel\">Weasel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"leopard\">Leopard</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"sage\">Sage</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"mage\">Mage</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Protection comes from the armor of all five pieces together, up to 75%.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>A full set of it protects</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/ede6dbbeeddfa6e7c5c3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>1.2 armor · 1.2 magic defense</td><td>12% blows · 12% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/bearhide-torso?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><im